{"ticker":"TRGP","updated":"2026-10-24T00:21:03Z","profile":{"longName":"Targa Resources Corp.","shortName":"Targa Resources, Inc.","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Midstream","country":"United States","website":"https://www.targaresources.com","fullTimeEmployees":3570,"marketCap":64837509120,"trailingPE":28.907265,"forwardPE":24.955618,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.8728614,"pegRatio":1.25,"targetMeanPrice":329.8095,"targetHighPrice":359.0,"targetLowPrice":294.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.042,"earningsGrowth":0.233,"grossMargins":0.43192002,"operatingMargins":0.27803,"profitMargins":0.13545,"totalRevenue":16741499904,"beta":0.796,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":307.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":150.0,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.73},"summary":"Targa Resources Corp., together with its subsidiaries, owns, operates, acquires, and develops a portfolio of complementary domestic infrastructure assets in North America. It operates in two segments, Gathering and Processing, and Logistics and Transportation. The company is involved in gathering, compressing, treating, processing, transporting, and selling natural gas; storing, fractionating, treating, transporting, and selling natural gas liquids (NGL) and NGL products, including services to liquefied petroleum gas exporters; and gathering, storing, terminaling, purchasing, and selling crude oil. It is involved in the purchase and resale of NGL products; and sale of propane, as well as provision of related logistics services to multi-state retailers, independent retailers, and other end-users. In addition, the company offers NGL balancing services; and transportation services to refineries and petrochemical companies in the Gulf Coast area, as well as purchases, markets, and resells natural gas. The company also leased and owned railcars, tractors, vacuum trucks and pressurized NGL barges. Targa Resources Corp. was incorporated in 2005 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","summary_zh":"Targa Resources Corp. 及其子公司在北美擁有、經營、收購和開發互補的國內基礎設施資產組合。它分為兩個部門：收集和加工部門以及物流和運輸部門。該公司從事天然氣的收集、壓縮、處理、加工、運輸和銷售；儲存、分餾、處理、運輸和銷售液化天然氣 (NGL) 和 NGL 產品，包括為液化石油氣出口商提供服務；以及收集、儲存、碼頭、採購和銷售原油。參與NGL產品的採購和轉售；和銷售丙烷，以及向多州零售商、獨立零售商和其他最終用戶提供相關物流服務。此外，該公司還提供NGL平衡服務；為墨西哥灣沿岸地區的煉油廠和石化公司提供運輸服務，以及購買、行銷和轉售天然氣。該公司還租賃和擁有軌道車、牽引車、真空卡車和加壓液化天然氣駁船。 Targa Resources Corp. 成立於 2005 年，總部位於德州休士頓。","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油和天然氣中游","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":162.41,"h":164.0,"l":160.58,"c":161.18,"v":921500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":161.47,"h":163.13,"l":160.95,"c":163.08,"v":1918900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":161.81,"h":166.48,"l":160.87,"c":165.17,"v":1276800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":165.84,"h":167.17,"l":164.24,"c":166.96,"v":1018500},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":167.02,"h":168.79,"l":166.84,"c":167.76,"v":986200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":166.76,"h":167.67,"l":165.11,"c":166.72,"v":1221800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":166.01,"h":166.74,"l":162.78,"c":163.55,"v":1111500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":163.97,"h":166.76,"l":163.02,"c":166.54,"v":1139800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":165.6,"h":165.84,"l":157.8,"c":162.35,"v":1636800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":163.52,"h":164.44,"l":159.1,"c":160.52,"v":1783700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":161.44,"h":162.96,"l":160.7,"c":161.28,"v":1223900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":161.37,"h":165.32,"l":160.86,"c":163.41,"v":1230700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":162.5,"h":165.81,"l":161.82,"c":165.24,"v":953900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":165.87,"h":168.07,"l":164.99,"c":166.38,"v":1008900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":166.95,"h":168.14,"l":163.07,"c":163.33,"v":1075100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":164.29,"h":164.67,"l":162.29,"c":162.94,"v":1463000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":162.73,"h":168.21,"l":162.73,"c":166.52,"v":1856000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":168.29,"h":171.21,"l":167.18,"c":170.12,"v":2164700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":170.15,"h":170.49,"l":163.72,"c":164.43,"v":3499300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":162.96,"h":167.91,"l":161.54,"c":165.22,"v":1586600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":165.58,"h":172.61,"l":1