dent infrastructure companies in North America. We own, operate, acquire, and develop a diversified portfolio of complementary domestic infrastructure assets.","zh":"Targa Resources Corp.（NYSE：TRGP）是一家特拉華州上市公司，成立於 2005 年 10 月。 Targa 是領先的中游服務供應商，也是北美最大的獨立基礎設施公司之一。我們擁有、經營、收購和開發互補的國內基礎設施資產的多元化投資組合。"},{"en":"To provide these services, we operate in two primary segments: (i) Gathering and Processing, and (ii) Logistics and Transportation (also referred to as our Downstream Business).","zh":"為了提供這些服務，我們主要經營兩個部門：(i) 採集和加工，以及 (ii) 物流和運輸（也稱為我們的下游業務）。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Logistics & Transportation","val":14341000000,"zh":"物流運輸"},{"name":"Gathering & Processing","val":2692600000,"zh":"收集與加工"}],"total":17028300000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Natural Gas Liquids Reserves","val":12079800000,"zh":"天然氣液體儲量"},{"name":"Service","val":2624800000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Natural Gas Reserves","val":2035700000,"zh":"天然氣儲量"},{"name":"Gathering & Processing Fees","val":1793200000,"zh":"收集和處理費"},{"name":"Storage Terminaling & Export","val":496800000,"zh":"儲存終端與導出"},{"name":"Oil & Condensate","val":448300000,"zh":"石油和凝析油"},{"name":"NGL Transportation Fractionation & Services","val":311600000,"zh":"NGL 運輸分餾和服務"},{"name":"Midstream Services Other","val":23200000,"zh":"中游服務其他"}],"total":17028300000}},"peers":["WES","PAGP","MPLX","OKE","PAA"]}}